  "description": "*\"Please let me write a masterpiece like no other.\"*\n\nYun Sang-Yeon, an aspiring writer who prayed to the monkey paw, who grants three wishes, is falsely accused and imprisoned. After 20 years in prison, he completes his book, \"The Writer in Solitary Cell,\" and receives recognition, but the void in his heart remains unfilled. Then, the monkey paw reappears, saying, \"I still have two wishes left.\"\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
